    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A collection of page-building blocks for WordPress Gutenberg Block Editor to make content creation easier, more flexible, &amp; more efficient.</p>\n<h3>Available Blocks</h3>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/buttons/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Buttons <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/columns/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Columns <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/container/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Container <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/countup/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">CountUp <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/heading/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Heading <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/hero/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Hero <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/icon/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Icon <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/image/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Image <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/popup/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Popup <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Slider/Carousel</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/social-links/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Social Links <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/spacer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Spacer <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tabs</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://enblocks.com/blocks/team/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Team <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></strong></p>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<p>Check out our <a href=\"https://enblocks.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation</a> for more information on the individual blocks and how to use them.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to &#8220;Plugins &gt; Add New&#8221; in your Dashboard and search for: enBlocks, Install and activate enBlocks plugin.</li>\n<li>Download the .zip from WordPress.org, and upload the folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory via FTP.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>In most cases, #1 will work fine and is way easier.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20add%20blocks%20to%20my%20page%3F'>\nHow do I add blocks to my page?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a new page or post</li>\n<li>Add a new block, and look for the &#8220;enBlocks&#8221; category</li>\n<li>Select a block &amp; start building.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='what%20theme%20should%20i%20use%3F'>\nWhat theme should I use?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>It will work with most of the block themes.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: Slider block</li>\n<li>Add: Tabs block</li>\n<li>Fix: Global padding issue</li>\n<li>Fix: Default values</li>\n<li>Removed: layout-flow class from column block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Various styling issues</li>\n<li>Update: Block component UI</li>\n<li>Update: Combined similar block component</li>\n<li>Updated: Removed force margin and padding</li>\n<li>Updated: Improved performance</li>\n<li>Removed: Cleanup unwanted files</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: Team block</li>\n<li>Add: Social Links block</li>\n<li>Fix: Button icon</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: Popup block</li>\n<li>Add: CountUps block</li>\n<li>Fix: Container block padding issue</li>\n<li>Fix: Spacing: margin auto</li>\n<li>Fix: Link decoration style issue</li>\n<li>Update: Heading block with span tag support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: CountUp block</li>\n<li>Fix: remove grid from Container block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: Hero Block</li>\n<li>Add: Hero Block variations</li>\n<li>Fix: spacing component</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update: container block with grid layout</li>\n<li>Optimized for performance</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: spacer block</li>\n<li>Update: container block with Flexbox layout</li>\n<li>Fix: animation issue</li>\n<li>Fix: buttons block issue</li>\n<li>Fix: size with responsive unit</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: fluid columns &#8211; column width issue</li>\n<li>Fix: grid-column and grid-row min max value issue</li>\n<li>Add: SVG icons</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: icon block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: packages upgrade issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: inline component help text</li>\n<li>Add: fancy border radius for image block</li>\n<li>Fix: background animated background issue</li>\n<li>Update: refactor unit component</li>\n<li>Update: refactor spacing component</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: image block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add: container block and heading block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Refactor: button block</li>\n<li>Fix: animation conflict with animated background</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added more variable fonts</li>\n<li>Added blueprint</li>\n<li>Added button accessibility options</li>\n<li>Fixed typography issues</li>\n<li>Fixed block animation conflict with animated background color</li>\n<li>Added columns block and column block</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
